# The repository ships the R scripts, the hand-maintained input tables they read,
# and the Shiny app together with the compacted data it loads at startup.
# Everything the pipeline generates in the project root — checkpoints, per-year
# harvests, intermediate CSVs, caches — is reproducible from those scripts and is
# kept out (it currently runs to ~14 GB). Manuscript analysis, figures, drafts and
# notes are kept out as well.

# ── Pipeline artefacts in the project root ───────────────────────────────────
# Deny by default, then re-admit the hand-maintained inputs below. A blanket rule
# is deliberate: Section 6 alone writes one .rds per year, and a new output must
# never be able to slip into a commit unnoticed.
#
# NOTE: these patterns are root-anchored ("/"), so they do NOT touch shiny/.
# When you add a NEW input table that clean_mining.R reads, add a matching "!"
# line below or it will be silently ignored.
/*.rds
/*.csv
/*.geojson
/*.tmp

# Hand-maintained pipeline inputs (see README → Input Files)
!/db_sf_countries.csv
!/db_sf_filter.csv
!/departments.csv
!/faculties.csv
!/researcher_faculties.csv
!/universities.csv
!/sf_countries_PA.geojson

# LLM verdict caches (Sections 16a, 16b, 17). Script output, but shipped on
# purpose: they freeze the organisation merges, the parent/child hierarchy and
# the faculty assignments this dataset was actually built with. With them in
# place the pipeline reproduces those decisions exactly and needs no Ollama
# server; delete one to have that stage classified again from scratch.
!/faculties_ollama.csv
!/org_merges_ollama.csv
!/org_hierarchy_ollama.csv

# Section 6 window cache (completed date windows, cleared per year on success)
.harvest_cache/

# Stale copy of the root-level Section 20 output. app.R reads the compacted
# complete_spacy_PA_geo.rds that Section 22 writes; nothing reads this GeoJSON.
shiny/complete_spacy_PA_geo.geojson

# ── Article analysis & figure scripts (not part of the pipeline / app) ────────
article_results_analysis.R
article_figures.R
article_figures_spatial.R
figures/

# ── Manuscript drafts, notes, and audits ──────────────────────────────────────
beyond_area_studies_methodological_appendix.md
beyond_area_studies_article_draft.md
beyond_area_studies_article_draft.copyedit.md
journal_targeting_note.md
pipeline_method.md
south_china_sea_relevance_audit_note.md

# ── R / editor session junk ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.Rhistory
**/.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
rsconnect/
shiny/rsconnect/
